42; <BR>6/25: Lupe Leo Ornelas; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped in ditch, car found abandoned <BR>1980&#42; <BR>10/25: Barbara Smith; blow to head, attempted strangulation, arson <BR>1979&#42; <BR>|- 04/28: Anna Williams &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; aborted attack, perp. hid in home awaiting victims, but apparently got bored and left before they returned, telco cut <BR>|- 5/1: Jerry Hunter &#40;Valley Center, KS&#41;; c.o.d. unspecified, car found abandoned <BR>|- 8/15: WPD releases the BTK Nancy Fox phone call to the media and it is heard by the public for the first time <BR>Graduated from Wichita State University Degree in Criminal Justice <BR>1978&#42; <BR>|- 1/31: A &#34;Curley Locks&#34; style poem which refers to the Vian murder, stamped with lettering blocks on an index card, is received by The Wichita Eagle-Beacon, but is initially ignored <BR>|- 2/10: Another letter from BTK is received by KAKE tv; it contains a poem based on &#34;Oh, Death&#34;, demands more media coverage and takes credit for an extra, unattributed, victim &#40;now assumed to be Kathryn Bright&#41; <BR>|- 5/10: Karen, Scott &amp; Mark Pretty &#40;Houston, TX&#41;; strangled/drown, bound with telephone cord, bodies found in bathtubs, car abandoned at nearby apartment complex, home invasion, children murdered ~[more] &#60;&#60;<a href="http://members.tripod.com/bailey_t/index-3.html" target=_top>http://members.tripod.com/bailey_t/index-3.html</a>&#62;&#62; <BR>His daughter is born June 13, 1978. <BR>1977&#42; <BR>03/17: Shirley Vian &#40;Wichita, KS&#41;, bound and strangled with garrote, hooded with plastic bag, children left unharmed, home invasion- perp. knocked &amp; was invited in by children; neighbor boy apparently witnessed BTK knock on door of Vian neighbor &#34;Cheryl&#34;, and saw him proceed on to Vian&#39;s after he got no answer at first home. <BR>|- 6/23: Nina Berardi; shot, telco cut, children unharmed, home invasion <BR>|- 7/11: Sandra K. Talbott &#40;Wichita/El Dorado, KS&#41;; c.o.d. unspecified, body dumped near &#34;Twin Bridges&#34; <BR>|- 11/26: Denise Rathbun last seen; found 2 weeks later; died of drowning and exposure, body dumped in creek under bridge <BR>|- 12/08: Nancy Fox &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; bound and strangled, driver&#39;s license stolen &#40;later contained in BTK 2004 Murdock Park message drop&#41;, home invasion <BR>|- 12/08: BTK calls emergency hotline from payphone to report the Fox murder, a recording &#40;almost certainly edited&#41; of the call &#40;listen at catchbtk.com &#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav</a>&#62;&#41; is later released by WPD <BR>1975&#42; <BR>|- 6/9: Carol Marsteller &#40;Sedgwick County/Wichita, KS&#41;; stabbed, body dumped... UPDATE 2/23/05: David Packard convicted &#60;<a href="http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id=15497" target=_top>http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id= 15497</a>&#62; of Marstellar murder in 3/1987, paroled 3/2004 [more at KAKE tv] &#60;<a href="http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html</a>&#62; [more at catchbtk.com] &#60;&#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html?1109184392" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html? 1109184392</a>&#62;&#62; <BR>His son is born on July 27, 1975.  <BR>1974&#42; <BR>01/15: Joseph, Julie, Josephine, &amp; Joseph Jr. &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; strangled, telco cut, some bodies hooded, Otero car moved/abandoned, items taken, home invasion, children murdered <BR>|- 1/21: Bruce Douglas &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; body found; asphyxiated and enclosed in trunk of car in rural area N.E. of Wichita, WSU student, car abandoned, car left running, LE ruled &#34;accidental suicide&#34; [more] &#60;<a href="http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag=kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag =kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1</a>